    <node id="&quot;小红&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">
小红 is a multifaceted character and student who is prominently featured in various problem-solving contexts, particularly involving arrays, permutations, and matrices. She is well-known for defining specific mathematical concepts such as the "good array" or "好数组," which includes properties associated with palindromic arrays, as well as the "双生数组" (twin array). She actively engages in tasks such as constructing permutations of length n with elements constrained within designated ranges [l_i, r_i], and solving problems related to arrays, including minimizing the range of an array through certain operations and constructing a 3x3 determinant under specific conditions.

In the realm of matrices,小红 defines what constitutes a "good matrix" and presents a challenge of transforming a given 01 matrix into this type through operations like swapping adjacent characters. She serves as the protagonist in these scenarios, often defining the rules and objectives herself, while sometimes seeking assistance to solve these problems. Her interactions consistently highlight her deep engagement with array manipulations, matrix transformations, and constrained problem-solving tasks. Although she is not always explicitly present in the code or error descriptions associated with the problems,小红 remains the central figure responsible for defining the problems and guiding the problem-solving process.&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is a person who defines what constitutes a good matrix and wants to transform a given matrix into this good matrix through a series of operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is a person mentioned in the problem description who needs assistance with determining the minimum cost to make a⊕b=c."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is a person who needs to determine the minimum cost of operations to make a⊕b=c."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is a person who is requested to determine the minimum cost to perform operations to satisfy the condition a\oplus b=c."&lt;SEP&gt;"小红 is a person asked to determine the minimum cost required to make a XOR b equal to c through operations."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d300103154c5f70514a4d86cc50a94df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11c9647dca18b1c8953d3725e54e2230&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ef1f71a373fc41a4b61f69de3413bf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b0b936b6b647a37d956fdf66cd57a12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec34f58c7576beef3e1ee627c114a25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f83dfef3345c73ed407093c9749130b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab26ec20fcd79dc385eb33e508c23dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0c9c6802989382170739955a5bae46c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5e545f02779dfb717361dfc31cb72c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06373e967b229fd23b64bfbbc0860861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ca5047ad2314016a91534ae51d7d7e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc7738af741f87817ecb754f66dfca01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e9ce81e31f65b60ba40e243a8d1ba19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2a57305752e3a687103dd58dbee53bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cfc0f9443b7ad1fe6055d788e835294&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6dde8d5dace842a3db295bc3a2b69c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab09dc98572215fda28e7c7cb77d448&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e3f9d595e0b4dc6b94e1564563f7ded&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2ac191ac64f16e456c655d4b8863811&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b590abbdea60c545ca54c73ea12cc6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79d7d963b8a058798cc18c9a690fc98e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4c926060a3af4a149ab3816fc63a59e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-802a483142e00c23622efad16d2e5519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63d7c8c700f1653b2de9c2e270fef6e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4df85ce295d523e4b50f09ff04d5c7bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9765d69bafc102e4cf79f177abd37634&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-512301a13a22c9eae82f981e0542065a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-264071873a8220efc52cdb3c6f973f1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56cf64b248d90f79e1afa9d0cd84c04a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46766da85f9f13835e435950173174a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d2aa75d8324c591292a5206cbd69bde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58fc77dbcd0a97d49a184217f891dcb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3eac5a8ba5cac7de40889ced9fb5315&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44c8edff064a63bf1c338d7c234b2385&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24e91156da41d8c127cfcd98fd99217c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63f089790696661ee6abceff90f9924d</data>
