    <node id="&quot;好数组&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A 'good array' is defined by小红 as an array that is not palindromic but can be made palindromic by modifying exactly one element."&lt;SEP&gt;"好数组 (good array) is the specific type of array defined by 小红, characterized by not being a palindrome initially but becoming one after modifying exactly one element."&lt;SEP&gt;"好数组 is an event where a defined array meets specific criteria, such as not being a palindrome but able to be transformed into one with a single modification."</data>
