    <node id="&quot;好矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The event or outcome of creating a matrix that meets specific conditions: being n x n, even rows and columns, and having specific patterns of 1s and 0s in divided quadrants."&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵 is defined as a matrix that meets specific conditions where left top region contains all '1' and other regions contain all '0'."&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵 is defined by 小红 as a matrix that satisfies two specific conditions: the matrix has even row and column counts, and when divided into four equal quadrants, the top-left quadrant has only '1' characters while the other three quadrants have only '0' characters."&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵满足行数和列数均为偶数，并且将矩阵平分为左上、右上、左下、右下四个区域后，四个区域大小完全一致，并且左上区域全部是1字符，其余三个区域全部是0字符"&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵是符合特定条件（行数和列数均为偶数，且左上区域全为1，其余区域全为0）的矩阵，小红的目标是通过操作将矩阵变成好矩阵。"&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵 (Good Matrix) represents the desired outcome or state that the matrix needs to be transformed into, which could be conceptually framed as an event or process of transformation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-56cf64b248d90f79e1afa9d0cd84c04a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa783b90d0126e6fe65518c125bef47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ef1f71a373fc41a4b61f69de3413bf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46766da85f9f13835e435950173174a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d2aa75d8324c591292a5206cbd69bde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5e545f02779dfb717361dfc31cb72c6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The entity referring to the mathematical structure of rows and columns created by 小红 which can be classified as good or not."&lt;SEP&gt;"矩阵 is an n x n grid containing only '0's and '1's given as input to the problem. The goal is to transform this matrix into a '好矩阵'."&lt;SEP&gt;"矩阵 is the mathematical structure that undergoes transformation in the problem, being manipulated to meet specific criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"矩阵 refers to a data structure composed of characters '0' and '1' that has rows and columns to solve a problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"矩阵是一个由字符`0'和`1'构成的n行n列的结构，小红的目标是将这个矩阵转换成好矩阵。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The matrix is a geometric arrangement of bricks in rows and columns, forming the spatial structure of the problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"矩阵 is an n × m arrangement of blocks arranged in rows and columns, with gray blocks that can be broken and blue diagonal blocks that form interconnected groups."&lt;SEP&gt;"矩阵 (matrix) is the primary organizational structure in the text, representing the collection of 0's and 1's that needs to be transformed to meet specific conditions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-56cf64b248d90f79e1afa9d0cd84c04a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d300103154c5f70514a4d86cc50a94df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0e2ac3fe25900f76cfe73eedcd9570d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae077aa7a5a85409843a4ac34869acd1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ef1f71a373fc41a4b61f69de3413bf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4c926060a3af4a149ab3816fc63a59e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24e91156da41d8c127cfcd98fd99217c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5e545f02779dfb717361dfc31cb72c6</data>
    </node>
