      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"四个区域 refers to the four equal parts of the matrix: left-top, right-top, left-bottom, and right-bottom, which must each be entirely 1's or 0's in a good matrix."&lt;SEP&gt;"四个区域 refers to the four equal quadrants (top-left, top-right, bottom-left, bottom-right) that the matrix is conceptually divided into for the definition of a '好矩阵'."</data>
