    <node id="&quot;牛可乐&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"牛可乐 is a person who defines the '可爱度' (lovable degree) of a string."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 is a person who defines the concept of 'String's Loveliness' and provides a definition for strings' attractiveness."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 is a person who has a grid of bricks arranged in an n×m matrix, with some bricks that can be broken and others that cannot."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 is a person who has an n × m matrix of blocks arranged in rows and columns and needs to separate 'blue maximum connected blocks' by calculating the minimum number of gray blocks to break."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 is the person who defined the concept of string可爱度, and is presenting the problem to the reader."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 is the identifier used in the problem statement, representing the individual who defines the 'cute' degree of a string."&lt;SEP&gt;"牛可乐 is the purported author of the problem description"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-67a35ea6ed4e42eb7c4874b218ee041d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0e2ac3fe25900f76cfe73eedcd9570d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae077aa7a5a85409843a4ac34869acd1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cb4bd7875d45de235db605ada816662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2d77cdcffc291f16acc127cdfe41569&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-435d0b64fef9c51a64d020305df4c4a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7638980c6db214619f264bda3c98a5b8</data>
    </node>
