      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The bricks are the main elements of interest, which can be classified as either breakable or non-breakable, and are arranged in a grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"砖块 are individual blocks making up the matrix, with some being gray and some being blue diagonal blocks."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ae077aa7a5a85409843a4ac34869acd1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0e2ac3fe25900f76cfe73eedcd9570d</data>
    </node>
