      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The grey bricks are those that can be broken in the matrix, representing an event where actions can be taken on these specific blocks."&lt;SEP&gt;"灰色砖块 are blocks shown in gray that can be broken or knocked down to allow 'blue maximum connected blocks' to fall off."</data>
