    <node id="&quot;炸鸡&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">
炸鸡 is a person who engages in multiple roles, primarily known for playing the game of tic-tac-toe (also referred to as 井字棋) against 小L. In these games, 炸鸡 uses the 'O' marker as their representation on the board. A notable aspect of their interactions in the game is their decision to grant 小L a special privilege, allowing the latter to make two consecutive moves during gameplay. This action is perceived by some as arrogant, suggesting that 炸鸡 may have a certain level of confidence or perhaps a playful attitude toward the game and 小L. 

Beyond their role in tic-tac-toe, 炸鸡 is also recognized for their teaching abilities. They have recently instructed 小L on several mathematical operations, specifically teaching them about squaring and square root. Additionally, 炸鸡 has provided educational guidance on bit operation knowledge, further demonstrating their role as an informant or mentor to 小L. In summary, 炸鸡 is a multifaceted individual who is both a gaming partner and a teacher to 小L, influencing the latter in both recreational and educational contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is a player in the tic-tac-toe game using O as their mark. They have given 小L a special privilege, suggesting they have some authority or control in the game."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4f761857c7438d0e8234494cb00c030e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4815d1a22ec8a935241a5f566cd9c42f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a376d30d059b09f44ce6681d11e112d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d34feb8b38494b33de0e8d583302bc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180c6e0fe94889fc71026468d48a172f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffc536726735c9911cd4a90d2ddb49f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65da65cd36531d031db5b8f1d3d85dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b256fd1c0676b66deece8e4e49ff37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c65c413a0785f44cfb35456d545b19d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7fa52e5b330629e1cee02304480f542&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;小L&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">
小L is a person who engages in multiple activities, including playing tic-tac-toe and learning about computational problems. In the game of tic-tac-toe, 小L acts as one of the players, using the "X" mark on the board. They are described as a novice player, currently taking the first move and possessing a unique privilege to take two consecutive steps at some point during the game. Their opponent in this game is 炸鸡.

Additionally, 小L is a student who is involved in learning about bit manipulation and number transformation operations. Under the guidance of 炸鸡, they have acquired knowledge of bit operations and are working on a specific problem involving three binary numbers, a, b, and c, with the goal of achieving a XOR b equals c. They have also learned two new operations for transforming a number n into a number m: multiplying by 2 or taking the integer part of the square root (flooring the result). These operations are applied to accomplish the transformation from n to m. Overall, 小L is actively engaged in both gaming and academic pursuits.&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is a player in a tic-tac-toe game who uses 'X' pieces and is currently about to make a move with a special privilege to take two consecutive actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"One of the players in the Tic-Tac-Toe game, using 'X' marks on the board and has a special ability to play two moves in a row once during the game."&lt;SEP&gt;"One of the players in the game of 井字棋 (Tic-Tac-Toe), represented by 'X' marks on the board."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is one of the two players in the tic-tac-toe game, represented by the symbol 'X'. They are described as a novice player."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L is a player in a game of tic-tac-toe, identified by the symbol 'X' on the game board."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d34feb8b38494b33de0e8d583302bc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4815d1a22ec8a935241a5f566cd9c42f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e931acf8bba8e661f930fa1ad11ddc08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180c6e0fe94889fc71026468d48a172f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffc536726735c9911cd4a90d2ddb49f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dc16b5f321438c090a3a2ab6291f38f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5df2edc3d03ec6c5e1b9a6d2ff7905f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64cb9d6867521174d17ba3213df66180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f761857c7438d0e8234494cb00c030e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-031bf50845b77cce37dae6bb7e48b3a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65da65cd36531d031db5b8f1d3d85dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7fa52e5b330629e1cee02304480f542</data>
    </node>
