    <node id="&quot;THE BINARY PROBLEM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Binary Problem is a mathematical challenge involving binary numbers a, b, and c with operations to make a⊕b=c."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;C&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"C represents one of the binary numbers in the problem, specifically the result binary number that should equal a⊕b."&lt;SEP&gt;"c is the result of the calculation a\oplus b=c."&lt;SEP&gt;"c is a binary number mentioned in the text, it seems to be a person name, where as per the context, the binary number in the problem"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54</data>
