    <edge source="&quot;炸鸡&quot;" target="&quot;小L&quot;">
      <data key="d3">155.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小L and 炸鸡 are opponents engaged in a game of 井字棋, taking turns to place their marks on the board."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L and 炸鸡 are opponents playing a game of Tic-Tac-Toe where they take turns placing their marks on a 3x3 grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L and 炸鸡 are opponents playing a game of tic-tac-toe against each other."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L and炸鸡 are players in the Tic-Tac-Toe Game, competing against each other."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 taught XiaoL about bit operation knowledge."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 taught 小L two new operations, establishing a teaching relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 taught 小L two new operations: squaring and square root, helping him learn how to transform number n into m."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 teaches bit operation knowledge to 小L, establishing a teacher-student relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 teaches Little L about bit manipulation knowledge."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 taught 小L two new operations: 平方 and 开方."&lt;SEP&gt;小L and 炸鸡 are opponents in the tic-tac-toe game, playing against each other with 小L using 'X' and 炸鸡 using 'O'.&lt;SEP&gt;小L and 炸鸡 are opponents in the tic-tac-toe game, with 小L using 'X' and 炸鸡 using 'O'.&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 granted 小L the privilege to take two consecutive moves in the game, likely due to 小L being a novice player."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 deliberately gave 小L an advantage by allowing them to make two consecutive moves once during their game of 井字棋."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 granted 小L a special privilege to make two consecutive moves during the game, which is a strategic advantage in their Tic-Tac-Toe match."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L and 炸鸡 are playing each other in a game of tic-tac-toe (井字棋)."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 gave 小L a special privilege to walk two steps in a row during the game."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-4f761857c7438d0e8234494cb00c030e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53fc62282a1bad52fcf26a22bb1d2063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-797fb9d828630915a36c7f38ac670256&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32b07be1497200073fc0ef9c06b5453&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180c6e0fe94889fc71026468d48a172f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffc536726735c9911cd4a90d2ddb49f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65da65cd36531d031db5b8f1d3d85dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c65c413a0785f44cfb35456d545b19d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5df2edc3d03ec6c5e1b9a6d2ff7905f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec8259c8baec36c3dade3722427d1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7433253258a222d25e3dedd5ea73b54</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
